# Geolocation / Location Service Configuration
# Optional: Specify an external or internal IP-geolocation service endpoint.
# The endpoint should return a JSON object containing a country code
# (e.g., {"country": "US"} or {"country_code": "US"}).
# If left blank, popup-new defaults to standard public IP verification (e.g., https://api.country.is/)
# or gracefully falls back to the neutral customer portal if unavailable or blocked.
VITE_GEO_API_URL=
